                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">A model with Gleaming Pinions gains the Hammer of Wrath (2) special rule. In addition, this model may re-roll charges in the charge phase even if it did not use it&apos;s Jump Pack in the assault phase.</characteristic>
