                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">The vehicle gains the Hatred (Chaos Space Marines) special rule. In addition, enemy Warlords within 12&quot; suffer -1 to their leadership characteristic.</characteristic>
