                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">The vehicle gains the Adamantium Will (5) special rule. The bonus granted by this special rule is increased to (4) against attacks made with the Psychic Focus special rule.</characteristic>
