                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">The Dreadnought has the Hatred (Chaos Space Marines) special rule. In addition, it automatically passes Dangerous Terrain tests incurred for passing through ruins and similar terrain.</characteristic>
