        <profile name="Balerion&apos;s Scales" id="8491-5808-7daa-a1fd" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">Balerion&apos;s Scales is a set of unique artificer power armour and is said to be the badge of office of the High-King of the Knights of Valyria. Balerion&apos;s Scales confer a 2+ armour save.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="High-King of The Knights of Valyria" id="0252-9698-0a93-fcc1" hidden="false">
          <description>The High-King of the Knights of Valyria has led his brethren through battles thought unwinnable and in victory  he has bought the unwavering loyalty of his chapter. 
Aurion and any units with the Knights Of Valyria special rule within 12&quot; of him have the Fearless special rule.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
