            <characteristic name="A" typeId="d535-b745-b613-a7ab">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="3b5e-ab67-ed36-a88f">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="d33e-1fdc-0c00-8cb8">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df9-f556-8725-fe75">Adamantium Will (3+), The Lion&apos;s Choler, The Point of the Blade</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Stasis Grenades" id="3443-b085-fda6-9552" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">Once per battle, Lion El’Jonson’s controlling player may choose to use stasis grenades when a Charge is declared for Lion El’Jonson and any unit he has joined. If the Charge for which the stasis grenades are used is successful then the target enemy unit or units must take an Initiative test (using the majority Initiative value of the unit(s)). If the Initiative test is passed then there is no further effect. If any of the target units fail the Test, then all enemy models in that unit must reduce their Initiative by -1 for the duration of the Assault phase in which the Charge was made.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The Leonine Panoply" id="badb-e04b-d993-f243" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">The Leonine Panoply provides a 2+ Armour Save and a 4+ Invulnerable Save. The first failed Invulnerable Save made for Lion El’Jonson each player turn may be re-rolled.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="The Emperor&apos;s Shield" id="6aac-e208-eede-244a" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
