              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">Each time an attack is allocated to this model with the Brutal (X) characteristic, subtract 1 from the Brutal characteristic. 
For example Brutal (3) becomes Brutal (2).</characteristic>
