                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Thunderwolf Mount" id="9037-2389-808a-dc41" hidden="false" typeId="d4b8-6c36-8bad-c884" typeName="Wargear Item">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1cc-ea5e-6a1d-d78e">All close combat attacks made by a model with a Thunderwolf mount have the Rending (6+) special rule. In addition, a model upgraded to have a Thunderwolf mount increases their Strength, Attacks and Wounds characteristics by 1 and it&apos;s movement characteristic to 12&quot;. In addition, the model gains the Hammer of Wrath (1), Relentless, Hit and Run and Cavalry special rules (these bonuses are already included in the profiles of models that have a Thunderwolf mount).</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
