      <rules>
        <rule name="Dark Angels Wargear" id="3260-bb6d-cde6-a7c1" hidden="false">
          <description>Artefacts recovered from sealed vaults deep within The Rock, believed to date to the tumultuous era of the Heresy. Their number is tightly restricted, for the Legion permits only a handful of such relics to see the light of war.

For every 500 points in this army, five weapons from the Dark Angels Wargear arsenal may be selected</description>
        </rule>
